Save K Rool Progresssave_k_rool_progress_Re-Entering K Rool after dying or pause exiting will spawn you in the latest phase you reached.  ù
Small Bananas always visiblesmall_bananas_always_visible]Small Bananas will always be visible regardless of whether you have the kong unlocked or not. §

Fast Hints
fast_hintsáWrinkly will appear faster out of her door. Additionally, pressing A during any text bubble growth will skip to it's fully grown state. &°
Brighten Mad Maze Maul Enemiesbrighten_mad_maze_maul_enemies]Enemies in Mad Maze Maul will be at full brightness, making them easier to see in dark areas. ô
